Options -MultiViews
RewriteEngine On
RewriteBase /bosch/barcelona/
RewriteRule ^index\.html$ - [L]
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule . /bosch/barcelona/index.html [L]
```

4. Guarda el archivo

